{"4767740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Inspector", "steam_appid": 4767740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been secretly hired by G.O.A.B to inspect a train for anomalies.<br>Inspect each cabin carefully and check whether or not an anomaly is present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach the final cabin to uncover the truth of the anomalies.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >G.O.A.B</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did they hire you in secret? Are they really who they say they are? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you trust them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/f01c6ab2d608999137df8dc792056296.poster.avif?t=1783112409\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/f01c6ab2d608999137df8dc792056296.webm?t=1783112409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/f01c6ab2d608999137df8dc792056296.mp4?t=1783112409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Your Choice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get out of the train and terminate the cabin if you found an anomaly, or continue to the next cabin if there are none. <br>Choose correctly and you may continue to the next car for inspection, choose incorrectly and you have to start your inspection from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's all up to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/0eeefc7ce2223ec81780f47e05bb43b0.poster.avif?t=1783112409\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/0eeefc7ce2223ec81780f47e05bb43b0.webm?t=1783112409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/0eeefc7ce2223ec81780f47e05bb43b0.mp4?t=1783112409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach The End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cabin looks the same.<br>That one poster is always there. The chairs all look the same. The broken door is always blocked. <br>But they still feel… <i>different</i>, are they really the same?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find out the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/05ab6c493f59b0d3a69543f6ded9c724.poster.avif?t=1783112409\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/05ab6c493f59b0d3a69543f6ded9c724.webm?t=1783112409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4767740/extras/05ab6c493f59b0d3a69543f6ded9c724.mp4?t=1783112409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been secretly hired by G.O.A.B to inspect a train for anomalies.<br>Inspect each cabin carefully and check whether or not an anomaly is present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reach the final cabin to uncover the truth of the anomalies.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >G.O.A.B</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did they hire you in secret? Are they really who they say they are? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you trust them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http